<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><meta name="description" content="Secure CareCycle Administration sign in."><title>CareCycle Administration sign in</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/defaultEntry.css"><script src="/accessibility.js" defer></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/ui-consistency.css"></head><body class="auth-page admin-auth"><a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a><main class="auth-shell" id="main-content" tabindex="-1"><h1 class="visually-hidden">CareCycle administration sign-in</h1><section class="auth-story admin-story" aria-labelledby="admin-title"><a class="brand brand-light" href="/admin/login"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">C</span><span>CareCycle Administration</span></a><div class="story-content"><span class="eyebrow">Platform operations only</span><h2 id="admin-title">Review organizations and participant accounts.</h2><p>This portal is for provisioned CareCycle staff who verify organizations, moderate accounts, and audit platform activity.</p></div><p class="story-note">This is not a government or ministry portal.</p></section><section class="auth-panel"><div class="auth-card"><nav class="portal-switch" aria-label="Choose sign-in portal"><a href="/login">Participant login</a><a class="active" href="/admin/login" aria-current="page">CareCycle admin</a></nav><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">Restricted access</span><h2>CareCycle Administration</h2><p class="auth-subtitle">Donor and NGO credentials cannot authenticate here.</p><% if (message) { %><div class="auth-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"><%= message %></div><% } %><form action="/admin/login" method="post" class="auth-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label for="email">Administration email</label><input id="email" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="username" required><label for="password">Password</label><input id="password" type="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" required><button type="submit" class="auth-primary">Enter CareCycle Administration</button></form><p class="auth-switch"><a href="/forgot-password">Forgot password?</a></p><p class="auth-switch">No provisioned account? <a href="/admin/access-request">Request administrative access</a></p></div></section></main></body></html>
